    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>You\u2019ve been invited to join an illustrious academic institution.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695780/extras/89a501cbe173e5d717faef09eead45ec.avif?t=1715143138\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br>Since its founding, Bellamy Academy has encouraged curiosity in its students and ambition from its headmasters. Throughout the years, additions have been built, secrets have been buried, and architecture and memories have become one. During your time at Bellamy Academy, you will explore classrooms, solve puzzles, and experience the history of the current headmaster and former student, Anya Ashby.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695780/extras/62ec82f89640397d2b193e9c21b06e08.avif?t=1715143138\" width=616 height=145 /></span><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> With Shining Eyes is a free game and always will be.<br></li><li> Solve casual puzzles in vibrant and surreal classrooms filled with surprises and secrets abound.<br></li><li> A short but densely packed experience, can be completed within 20 to 40 minutes.<br></li><li> Relaxing music and scenery around every corner.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>You\u2019ve been invited to join an illustrious academic institution.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695780/extras/89a501cbe173e5d717faef09eead45ec.avif?t=1715143138\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><br>Since its founding, Bellamy Academy has encouraged curiosity in its students and ambition from its headmasters. Throughout the years, additions have been built, secrets have been buried, and architecture and memories have become one. During your time at Bellamy Academy, you will explore classrooms, solve puzzles, and experience the history of the current headmaster and former student, Anya Ashby.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695780/extras/62ec82f89640397d2b193e9c21b06e08.avif?t=1715143138\" width=616 height=145 /></span><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> With Shining Eyes is a free game and always will be.<br></li><li> Solve casual puzzles in vibrant and surreal classrooms filled with surprises and secrets abound.<br></li><li> A short but densely packed experience, can be completed within 20 to 40 minutes.<br></li><li> Relaxing music and scenery around every corner.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Uncover secrets, experience history, solve puzzles and understand one another. Immerse yourself and explore a surreal and colorful world in this short, first-person adventure.",
